    "Apply vector decomposition to 2D projectile motion and explain independence of horizontal and vertical motion (a_x = 0, gravity only vertical).",
    "Track how projectile vertical velocity reaches zero at maximum height and interpret the corresponding position/trajectory.",
    "Predict qualitative effects of changing launch angle and speed on range and maximum height; identify maximum-range angle for fixed speed."
